86ae8010-961d-4463-a5fd-7004d690936f	1e4807da-38da-4188-a9cd-ddc232e54712	assistant	Bravo Bob (PC 05)! I inspected Test.java and see no `Distributeur` class yet, so your dispenser cannot display its menu. Remember Chapter 2 loops guarantee at least one display with `do...while`, unlike `while`, and keyboard input starts with `Scanner clavier = new Scanner(System.in)` plus `nextInt()` for `choix`. Think of the café-thé-jus menu needing one guaranteed showing before testing `choix != 0`. What first skeleton will you create in Distributeur.java to display the menu once and read choix inside a do...while?	{"label": "Chapter 2 (Slide 27): Les boucles : La boucle while", "en_note": "do-while guarantees one menu display and Scanner reads console choix.", "pdf_url": "https://peddvhsykuglvicfaezr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-pdfs/java_oop/chapters/ch2_elements_de_base.pdf", "page_number": 27, "chapter_code": "CH2_ELEMENTS_DE_BASE", "slide_markdown": {"en": "### Loops: The while Loop\\n#### Loops\\n- Loops allow repeating a block of instructions several times:\\n  - `while`\\n  - `do...while`\\n  - `for`\\n#### The while loop\\n- The condition is evaluated before each iteration.\\n- If the condition is false from the start, the block is never executed.\\n#### Syntax\\n```java\\nwhile (condition) {\\n    // instructions to repeat\\n}\\n```\\n#### Example\\n```java\\nint i = 0;\\nwhile (i < 5) {\\n    System.out.println(i);\\n    i++;\\n}\\n```", "fr": "### Les boucles : La boucle while\\n#### Les boucles\\n- Les boucles permettent de répéter un bloc d'instructions plusieurs fois :\\n  - `while`\\n  - `do...while`\\n  - `for`\\n#### La boucle while\\n- La condition est évaluée avant chaque itération.\\n- Si la condition est fausse dès le départ, le bloc n'est jamais exécuté.\\n#### Syntaxe\\n```java\\nwhile (condition) {\\n    // instructions à répéter\\n}\\n```\\n#### Exemple\\n```java\\nint i = 0;\\nwhile (i < 5) {\\n    System.out.println(i);\\n    i++;\\n}\\n```"}}	[]	12676	2026-11-02 23:00:03.529435+00	act_1
